# ---- Booklit durable storage -------------------------------------------------
# Accounts, tethers (follows), sparks (likes), duels, challenges and cloud
# reading snapshots are stored in one server document. For production, point
# Booklit at a database so app updates / restarts never erase accounts.

# Option A (recommended): Supabase Postgres REST.
# Run the SQL in README.md -> "Durable accounts", then paste:
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
BOOKLIT_SUPABASE_TABLE=booklit_store

# Option B: persistent disk mount (Render disk, Fly volume, VPS path).
# BOOKLIT_DATA_DIR=/var/data/booklit

# Session signing secret (keep it stable across deploys).
# BOOKLIT_AUTH_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
